  "title": "Spicy Korean Chicken",
  "description": "Korean chicken thighs are slightly spicy and slightly sweet, marinated in a flavorful mixture of sesame oil, soy sauce, ginger, garlic, and Korean chile paste.",
  "authors": [
    "MrsBryant"
  ],
